ting\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-25\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"While Harry decides to pursue a new charitable project, Crabb is faced with a massive professional dilemma. Agnes faces an unexpected challenge very close to home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yGv0QcpTpPy6rD2iVEhjdPzbawM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-01\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Harry goes ahead with his plans for the estate, buying a field at auction - only to find there is an unexpected rival bidder. Henri continues to behave erratically.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k3bkZ5PRCzOREthVKhQj3bu3eT1.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Harry and Nancy bring the injured Kitty to hospital, whilst Frank rushes to be by her side.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yrehFQKLOrHtH92Wb3k9lLR9Gtg.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Harry and Nancy are enjoying the passion of their romance, having been together secretly for a while now. But as always, Harry has business to attend to.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kllj6k9diYFxfBf2cNOuh9WqzPH.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-22\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Harry places Violette under house arrest after the police raid at Colleano’s.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/10ozdnabbQdfjzf5sZcFPJV8RHr.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-01\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Harry offers his support when a situation sends ripples through the Selfridge’s staff and Mardle attempts to maintain composure but struggles with the weight of her secret.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jIbNVxjP8n0D60EXh9DOaMa2uGt.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"To celebrate the signing of the landmark Treaty of Versailles, Harry consults his newly appointed Head of Press and Print on a way to mark this moment in store, who is none other than old friend Frank Edwards.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tMEjtr3MITs5PJkecH8FHeR26r.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Harry holds the biggest flash sale in the store's history, taking a massive gamble in the process. Nancy finds it difficult keeping her engagement from Gus.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fceChW0oJYk9K5ZANKEcDxKOGxi.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-22\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Harry and Lord Loxley clash in a dramatic confrontation. Princess Marie probes into the status of the Selfridge Estate. Gordon faces a big romantic decision.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nfPy3cvDjUWnoMw4cVstUgZ1NTb.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-29\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2013-01-06\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}